Section 34.
The Transaction Committee shall have the powers and
duties as follows:to examine a transaction or property connected with the
commission of an offence;
to give an order withholding the transaction under section 35 or
section 36;
to carry out the acts under section 48;
to submit to the Board a report on the result of the execution of this
Act;to perform other acts as entrusted by the Board.

